    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ДнР#\nINDIANAPOLIS\nEAST\nWEST\nCROSSROADS\nOF THE AIR\nST\nNORTH\nSOUTH\nCCT25\n4 AM\n1930\nAIR MAL\nINDIANAPOLIS\nap99140k10\nстоВі 25\nLIFORNIA\nLOS ANGELES\n• 3LA0\nLAST YORK LOS AREN\nShirley Ann Turner,\n1623 Spann Ave.,\nIndianapolis, Ind.\nVIA AIR MAIL\nVia Las Augeles\nINAUGURATING COAST TO COAST AIR SERVICE\nАНАДОКНО",
      "Indianapolis, Ind.\nOctober 23,\n1930.\nDear Shirley Ann:\nI am sending you this letter as a\nremembrance of the memorable event of the first\nTranscontinental Air Mail flight from New York to\nLos Angeles California which will arrive in Indianapolis\non Saturday, October 25, 1930.\nLovingly\nYour Daddy"
    ],
